# Arch AUR package metadata for openjiuwen-web

These PKGBUILD + nginx sample-config files are released under the
[0BSD license](https://spdx.org/licenses/0BSD.html), matching the
convention of the AUR repo itself.

The packaged upstream software (openJiuwen Studio frontend) is Apache-2.0
licensed; the bundled HarmonyOS Sans fonts are additionally licensed under
HarmonyOS Sans Fonts License (Huawei Device Co., Ltd., 2021) — see
`/usr/share/licenses/openjiuwen-web/{LICENSE,HarmonyOS-Sans-Fonts.LICENSE}`
after install.